  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 5f7201a12d95ffc409449d95f23cf332, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 1
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_FontData:
    m_Font: {fileID: 12800000, guid: 4e1efa77e0366dd43a52d4d409337443, type: 3}
    m_FontSize: 30
    m_FontStyle: 0
    m_BestFit: 0
    m_MinSize: 3
    m_MaxSize: 40
    m_Alignment: 0
    m_AlignByGeometry: 0
    m_RichText: 1
    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: 'How to play:

    Travel the land and encounter enemies. You can catch
    them for them to be on your team, or defeat them to gain xp and gold. Enemies
    respawn after a certain amount of time based on their health. The higher the
    health the longer the respawn time. Press B to open your bag to see your health
    packs(tap the red plus next to a team member to heal them), defense boost, attack
    boost, and catchers. Find the shop to buy more. Some enemies are harder some
    easier. Find and catch the easy ones first to build your team. If one Squere
    defeates an enemy, all team members get a small portion of the xp. The red text
    is your health and the blue text is your AP. Everytime you use a move AP is used
    so press "charge AP" to regain all your AP back but it takes up a turn. Some
    enemies have moves that give status effect. Each status effect does something
    different so be carful. But if all your allies are defeated then it all ends
    so make sure to keep track of health. Thats all you need to know. Now good luck!'
